[node name="TitleRichTextLabel" parent="Left/Nodes" parent_id_path=PackedInt32Array(1644936578) index="1" unique_id=1098942946]
text = "[b][u]The Secret Code: How does it work ?[/u][/b]"

[node name="Label1" type="Label" parent="Left/Nodes" parent_id_path=PackedInt32Array(1644936578) index="2" unique_id=2117813230]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(1, 0)
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "As said before, the secret code is a String of a lenght of 100 .
If simplified, it's a chain of 100 characters .

The safe have a system that create a new secret code each time someone enter in the room . And it is fully random in two ways :
- The safe choose what to put in 90% of the secret code;
- The safe want a big security, so he knows he can't trust himself to create the entire secret code . So he fetch some data from somewhere else that do not depend on him . And put the data inside the secret code .

And after this work is done, the phase two start (a second phase, yes) ."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

