theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "In the second phase, the safe is not sure the secret code is secured enought . So he will encrypt his random mess 5 times in a row, with 5 random encryption methods that he has choosen randomly .

Why ?
Because, as if the secret code is not the encrypted version . Your handbook only know the encrypted version, and all the encryption methods used .
So you will have to decrypt the encrypted secret code to unlock the safe with the correct secret code .

Easy, right ?
We didn't lied to you at the interview, see ;)"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3
